:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 14 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨雾弥漫的栈桥第五根石柱旁，<<else>>海风清爽的栈桥第五根石柱旁，<</if>>石柱铁环上挂着一只被浪冲上来的铜壳气压表，旁边的石缝里卡着一把水手折刀。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_moment_14 is 1>>
栈桥石柱上的铜壳气压表今日已归位，表盘干爽如新。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 15]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-reg6-foghorn-moment-14">
<<investigateicon>><<link "挑开表盖 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-foghorn-moment-14">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_moment_14 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_foghorn_moment_14_rew")>><<money 360>>底盖弹开，防水夹层里藏着几枚旧港银币。<<else>>铜壳气压表内壁干燥如初，指针重新恢复灵敏。<</if>><span class="green">你在栈桥石柱旁起出了水手遗留的气压表暗藏。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往栈桥 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	折刀尖在铜壳边缘滑了一下，浪花溅湿了裤脚。<span class="red">你退上半级石阶甩干水珠。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "排干海水 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-foghorn-moment-14">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_moment_14 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg6_foghorn_0"] to 1>><<history 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_foghorn_moment_14_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>海水顺排气孔流尽，表座下露出一小卷航标纪念铜牌。<<else>>齿轮恢复清脆滴答声，表盘刻度清晰如新。<</if>><span class="green">你巧妙排干海水修复了古旧气压表。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[深入查看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 15]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	拧旋钮时海风吹滑了指尖，海水没能一次排净。<span class="red">你拿干布擦干表冠退后半步。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 15 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night" and Weather.precipitation is "rain">>细雨敲打着守塔人石屋的后窗台，<<else>>海光映照的守塔人石屋后窗台下，<</if>>窗台木槽里摆着一只装满海盐颗粒的防潮铜罐，罐旁压着一张涂蜡信笺与一把小铜匙。
<<if $mpClues["clue_reg6_foghorn_0"]>><span class="teal">借着刚修好栈桥气压表时的手感，你一眼认出了窗台防潮铜罐的锁扣方向。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_moment_15 is 1>>
石屋后窗台的防潮盐罐今日已封妥，海盐颗粒雪白干燥。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 16]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-reg6-foghorn-moment-15">
<<investigateicon>><<link "旋开盐罐 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-foghorn-moment-15">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg6_foghorn_0'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_moment_15 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_foghorn_moment_15_rew")>><<money 380>>铜罐底层埋着一袋守塔人留下的采买零钱。<<else>>海盐颗粒洁白干爽，防潮铜罐密封得严丝合缝。<</if>><span class="green">你从防潮盐罐底找出了守塔人的备用钱袋。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往栈桥 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	小铜匙沾了海盐微涩，拧动时卡在了半途。<span class="red">你擦净匙齿退开半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 15]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "揭看信笺 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-foghorn-moment-15">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_moment_15 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg6_foghorn_1"] to 1>><<history 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_foghorn_moment_15_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>信笺夹层里滑出一张可兑付的港务守塔人铜印。<<else>>涂蜡信笺上的灯语口诀字迹端正清晰。<</if>><span class="green">你顺利参透了守塔人留下的涂蜡信笺。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[深入查看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 16]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	涂蜡信笺的封边粘得颇紧，揭动时差点撕破纸角。<span class="red">你忙停住指尖平复呼吸。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 15]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Foghorn 16 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>涨潮前的断桅沉船滩礁石凹槽里，<<else>>风平浪静的断桅沉船滩礁石凹槽里，<</if>>半截船首像底座下卡着一只红铜罗盘盒，旁边散落着几根坚韧的鲸须撬片与细麻绳。
<<if $mpClues["clue_reg6_foghorn_1"]>><span class="teal">对照涂蜡信笺背面标出的沉船方位，你在断桅滩船首像下准确摸到了红铜罗盘盒。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_moment_16 is 1>>
船首像底座下的红铜罗盘盒今日已查验，潮水缓缓漫过礁盘。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-reg6-foghorn-moment-16">
<<investigateicon>><<link "顶开罗盘盒 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-foghorn-moment-16">>
<<if (($physique or 10000) + ($mpClues['clue_reg6_foghorn_1'] ? 600 : 0)) gte 11400 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_moment_16 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_foghorn_moment_16_rew")>><<money 400>>罗盘盒内衬里收着几枚保存完好的远洋银币。<<else>>磁针稳稳指向正北，红铜盒面泛着古朴光泽。<</if>><span class="green">你从船首像下完好取出了红铜罗盘盒。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往栈桥 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	礁石青苔打滑，撬片在铜盒边沿擦偏了半寸。<span class="red">你扶稳船首像定下心神。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 16]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拖出铜盒 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-foghorn-moment-16">>
<<if ($willpower or 0) gte 430 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_moment_16 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg6_foghorn_2"] to 1>><<history 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_foghorn_moment_16_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>铜盒顺着石槽滑入掌心，底格里还藏着一份海图信物铜章。<<else>>细麻绳打结牢靠，未惊动四周碎石便取出了铜盒。<</if>><span class="green">你用巧劲将红铜罗盘盒无损拖出石缝。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[深入查看 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	细麻绳在礁石棱角上卡了一下，没能一次拉出铜盒。<span class="red">你松开麻绳绕开锋利石棱。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 16]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Foghorn 7 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜雾渐浓的海蚀回音廊中段石拱下，<<else>>潮音低回的海蚀回音廊中段石拱下，<</if>>一名提着防风灯的老引航员正对着石壁风向盘皱眉，石台上放着一瓶润滑鲸油与一把铜尺。
<<if $mpClues["clue_reg6_foghorn_2"]>><span class="teal">怀里装着刚取出的红铜罗盘盒，你与回音廊老引航员核对风向盘时分外投机。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_encounter_7 is 1>>
回音廊中段的石壁风向盘今日已校妥，指针随风轻转。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-reg6-foghorn-encounter-7">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "帮他点轴 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-foghorn-encounter-7">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg6_foghorn_2'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_encounter_7 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_foghorn_encounter_7_rew")>><<money 420>>风向盘重新顺滑转动，老引航员笑着塞给你一袋引航津贴。<<else>>老引航员冲你点头致谢，顺手指点了今日的平潮时刻。<</if>><span class="green">你帮老引航员修好了回音廊的风向盘。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往栈桥 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	回音廊穿堂风过急，鲸油滴落时偏了半寸。<span class="red">老引航员替你挡住风口。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "校对刻度 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-foghorn-encounter-7">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_encounter_7 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg6_foghorn_3"] to 1>><<history 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_foghorn_encounter_7_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>刻度分毫不差，老引航员大加赞赏，多付了你一份测绘补贴。<<else>>风向盘指针与海风完美同步，回音廊内海鸣清越。<</if>><span class="green">你精准的测绘手法赢得了老引航员的敬重。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[深入查看 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜尺贴上刻度环时被穿堂海风吹偏了半格。<span class="red">老引航员伸手替你扶稳铜尺。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Encounter Foghorn 8 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>海雨初歇的雾角灯塔底层蓄水室旁，<<else>>天光透入的雾角灯塔底层蓄水室旁，<</if>>巡检水手正吃力地扳动生锈的淡水过滤阀，脚边放着一袋净水木炭与一柄加长管钳。
<<if $mpClues["clue_reg6_foghorn_3"]>><span class="teal">凭你帮老引航员校准好的风向刻度，你算准平潮间隙来到蓄水室帮水手检修阀门。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_encounter_8 is 1>>
灯塔底层的淡水过滤槽今日已换炭完毕，水流清澈。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 17]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-reg6-foghorn-encounter-8">
<<socialiseicon>><<link "帮他旋阀 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-foghorn-encounter-8">>
<<if (($athletics or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg6_foghorn_3'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($physique or 10000) gte 11400>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_encounter_8 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_foghorn_encounter_8_rew")>><<money 440>>过滤阀应声旋开，巡检水手感激地与你平分了今日的检修奖金。<<else>>清澈淡水顺畅流入储水池，水手热情地请你喝了杯热茶。<</if>><span class="green">你与巡检水手合力修通了灯塔淡水阀。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 17]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	管钳齿口在湿滑铁管上滑了一下，震得虎口微麻。<span class="red">水手连忙帮你扶稳管身。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "填装滤槽 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-foghorn-encounter-8">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($willpower or 0) gte 430>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_foghorn_encounter_8 to 1>><<history 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_foghorn_encounter_8_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>过滤后的淡水清冽甘甜，水手欣喜地将整份水质补贴塞给了你。<<else>>木炭层铺得匀实平整，蓄水室里的水声清脆悦耳。<</if>><span class="green">你妥善换好了灯塔蓄水室的净水炭层。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[回看前段 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Foghorn 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	净水木炭倒得略快，几块大颗粒卡在了滤网口。<span class="red">巡检水手拿木铲帮你拨平炭层。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Foghorn 8]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回雾角灯塔 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Clockwork 14 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>深夜的青铜齿轮回廊三号传动井旁，<<else>>机括城青铜齿轮回廊三号传动井旁，<</if>>检修踏板下卡着一只黄铜记数器，旁边的挂钩上垂着一柄六角套筒与一卷绝缘胶布。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[离开 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg6_clockwork_moment_14 is 1>>
三号传动井的黄铜记数器今日已检修完毕，字轮归零。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 15]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-reg6-clockwork-moment-14">
<<investigateicon>><<link "卸下记数器 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-clockwork-moment-14">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_clockwork_moment_14 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_clockwork_moment_14_rew")>><<money 360>>记数器底盒里塞着早年工匠留下的几枚纪念银币。<<else>>记数器字轮归零顺畅，齿轮咬合声匀净清脆。<</if>><span class="green">你从传动井旁顺利取下了黄铜记数器。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往齿轮回廊 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	套筒口径略滑，扳动螺栓时震得指尖发麻。<span class="red">你换了个支点稳住手腕。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "加固导线 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-clockwork-moment-14">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 250 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_clockwork_moment_14 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg6_clockwork_0"] to 1>><<skulduggery 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_clockwork_moment_14_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>导线接口恢复通电，指示灯亮起的同时弹出一匣检修信物铜牌。<<else>>绝缘胶布缠得严丝合缝，传动井仪表重归稳定。<</if>><span class="green">你干净利落地排除了记数器的线路隐患。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[深入查看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 15]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	绝缘胶布在油污导线外滑脱了一圈，没能缠紧。<span class="red">你先用棉纱擦净导线外壁。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 14]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Region Moment Clockwork 15 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>蒸汽压力室的副冷凝塔底座旁，<<else>>机括城蒸汽压力室的副冷凝塔底座旁，<</if>>铜制集水盘里沉着一枚刻有齿纹的银质阀芯，旁边放着一把长柄磁力棒与一只油布袋。
<<if $mpClues["clue_reg6_clockwork_0"]>><span class="teal">凭着刚缠好三号井记数器线路的绝缘手法，你在副冷凝塔旁一眼看清了集水盘结构。</span><</if>>
