<br>
<<if $daily.mpReg6_clockwork_moment_15 is 1>>
副冷凝塔的铜集水盘今日已清理干净，滴水声规律轻快。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 16]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-reg6-clockwork-moment-15">
<<investigateicon>><<link "吸出垫圈 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-clockwork-moment-15">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg6_clockwork_0'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_clockwork_moment_15 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_clockwork_moment_15_rew")>><<money 380>>银阀芯连同盘底的一小袋值班银币一并落入你手。<<else>>集水盘排水孔重归通畅，冷凝水滴落声规律轻快。<</if>><span class="green">你从副冷凝塔集水盘里起出了银质阀芯。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往齿轮回廊 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Corridor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	集水盘水温尚热，水汽熏红了你的手腕。<span class="red">你忙缩回手吹了吹热气。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 15]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "夹起阀芯 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-clockwork-moment-15">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_clockwork_moment_15 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg6_clockwork_1"] to 1>><<skulduggery 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_clockwork_moment_15_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>银阀芯完好装入油布袋，你在底座暗格里还摸到了一卷工坊礼券。<<else>>磁力棒吸净了盘底铁屑，冷凝塔运转得愈发平稳。<</if>><span class="green">你用巧手将集水盘清理得干干净净。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[深入查看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 16]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	集水盘底水汽模糊了视线，夹取银阀芯时偏了半寸。<span class="red">你等水面波纹平息后再看。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Clockwork 15]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回机括城 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
