月泉祭坛东侧石渠的松果铜球今日已疏通归位。
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[继续深入 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 16]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-reg6-druid-moment-15">
<<investigateicon>><<link "挑出松针 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-druid-moment-15">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_reg6_druid_0'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 250 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_druid_moment_15 to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_druid_moment_15_rew")>><<money 380>>青铜滤水球应声旋开，中心藏着一枚温润玉扣与几枚古币。<<else>>引水石渠恢复叮咚流淌，月泉水面澄澈如镜。<</if>><span class="green">你疏通并打开了月泉石渠的松果铜球。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往石柱群 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石渠泉水冰凉，探手时冻得指尖微微发麻。<span class="red">你握拳哈了口热气暖手。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 15]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回石环 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "旋开铜球 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-druid-moment-15">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or ($history or 0) gte 240>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_druid_moment_15 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg6_druid_1"] to 1>><<history 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_druid_moment_15_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>蜂蜡布防滑趁手，铜球一拧即开，你将里面的祭坛奉纳古铜徽章收入怀中。<<else>>松果鳞片孔隙洁净通畅，泉水流过时发出清越水音。<</if>><span class="green">你巧用蜂蜡布旋开了湿滑的松果青铜球。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[深入查看 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 16]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	蜂蜡布裹在湿漉漉的松果铜球外，拧动时差了半圈。<span class="red">你先把铜球表面的泉水擦干。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Moment Druid 15]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回石环 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
