:: MP Region Moment Druid 16 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>古根地穴深处的盘根石龛内，<<else>>深林古石环古根地穴的盘根石龛内，<</if>>两股粗壮橡树根之间夹着一只白桦皮经筒，龛旁放着一碟松脂粉与一把扁木楔。
