	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_druid_moment_16_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>经筒顺滑滑入掌心，内层羊皮卷里还夹着一张草药收购纪念铜牌。<<else>>松脂粉清香干燥，将石龛内的湿气驱散了大半。<</if>><span class="green">你借松脂粉无损抽出了百年白桦皮经筒。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[深入查看 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Druid 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
