	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_druid_encounter_7_rew")>><<money 420>>皮鼓重归浑厚响亮，巡山青年高兴地将林场发的补贴分了你一半。<<else>>青年敲了两下鼓面，远方林哨立刻传来了回音。<</if>><span class="green">你帮巡山青年修好了瞭望台的信号皮鼓。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[前往石柱群 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Pillars]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	鼓皮绷得极紧，骨针穿刺时指腹被顶得发酸。<span class="red">青年拿皮顶针套在你手指上。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[再试一次 (0:04)|MP Region Encounter Druid 7]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[返回石环 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "调准鼓音 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-reg6-druid-encounter-7">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 250 or ($maths or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpReg6_druid_encounter_7 to 1>><<set $mpClues["clue_reg6_druid_3"] to 1>><<history 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("reg6_druid_encounter_7_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>牛筋线绷得匀称紧实，青年钦佩不已，把整份巡山向导信物铜章塞给了你。<<else>>鼓声沉稳有力地传遍山谷，林间鸟雀振翅高飞。<</if>><span class="green">你精湛的调鼓手法赢得了巡山青年的敬佩。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
